   452	/**Function*************************************************************
   453	
   454	  Synopsis    [Runs the stmap57 mapper probe.]
   455	
   456	  Description [stmap57 measures direct SCL load/max-cap pressure after an
   457	  initial base-gain map, keeps the stmap49 high-pressure SCL/genlib gain, and
   458	  remaps through the reviewed stmap56 mapper mode while feeding raw load
   459	  pressure, rather than sink-criticality-weighted pressure, into that mode. The
   460	  hypothesis is that raw first-pass pressure can provide paired evidence for
   461	  candidates that previously looked cut-only to the mapper.]
